 -----------------------------------------------------

                      Bubble Sort

------------------------------------------------------



1 . Best Case : O(n);
2 . average Case:O(n^2);
3 . Worst Case : O(n^2);

The Maximum Number of Swaps of Bubble Sort are : n(n-1)/2;


